    <item>
      <title>Install Azure AD Connect (Video)</title>
      <link>https://diecknet.de/en/2020/06/23/Install-Azure-AD-Connect-Video/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 23 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>Andreas Dieckmann</author>
      <guid>https://diecknet.de/en/2020/06/23/Install-Azure-AD-Connect-Video/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xQYsSngTSnU&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; &gt;&lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://diecknet.de/images/2020/2020-06-23_AzureADConnect-Part2-YT-Thumbnail.png&#34; alt=&#34;Azure AD Connect Install (YouTube)&#34;  title=&#34;Azure AD Connect Install (YouTube)&#34;  /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
I created a &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xQYsSngTSnU&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; &gt;YouTube video&lt;/a&gt; about configuring Azure AD Connect and Password Hash Sync. In this blog post I only refer to a few related links. Also watch the previous &lt;a href=&#34;https://diecknet.de/2020/06/05/Plan-and-Prepare-Azure-AD-Connect-Video/&#34; &gt;video on planning and preparing Azure AD Connect&lt;/a&gt; first!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;further-reading&#34;&gt;Further Reading&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Download Azure AD Connect: &lt;a href=&#34;https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=615771&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; &gt;Azure AD Connect Download (Microsoft.com)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diecknet blog post: &lt;a href=&#34;https://diecknet.de/2020/06/05/Plan-and-Prepare-Azure-AD-Connect-Video/&#34; &gt;Plan and Prepare Azure AD Connect&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;YouTube video: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_feF0VPL2Ps&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; &gt;Azure AD Connect: Plan and Prepare&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardware requirements for the Azure AD Connect server: &lt;a href=&#34;https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/active-directory/hybrid/how-to-connect-install-prerequisites#hardware-requirements-for-azure-ad-connect&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; &gt;Prerequisites for Azure AD Connect - Hardware requirements for Azure AD Connect (docs.microsoft.com)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Plan and Prepare Azure AD Connect Correctly (Video)</title>
