&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_feF0VPL2Ps&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; &gt;&lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://diecknet.de/images/2020/2020-06-06_AzureADConnect-YT-Thumbnail.png&#34; alt=&#34;Azure AD Connect: Plan and Prepare (YouTube)&#34;  title=&#34;Azure AD Connect: Plan and Prepare (YouTube)&#34;  /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;azure-ad-connect-decision-tree&#34;&gt;Azure AD Connect Decision Tree&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://data.diecknet.de/dl/2020-06-05/Azure_AD_Connect_Entscheidungsbaum.zip&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; &gt;&lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://diecknet.de/images/2020/2020-06-05_Azure_AD_Connect_Entscheidungsbaum.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Azure AD Connect Decision Tree (free download)&#34;  title=&#34;Azure AD Connect Decision Tree (free download)&#34;  /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
